{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["אֲשֶׁר נָשִׂיא יֶחֱטָא — like: ״ואשר נתן כתר מלכות בראשו״. Like: ״וכתר מלכות אשר נתן בראשו״." "מִצְוֺת יְהוָה אֱלֹהָיו — that is, if he is one who fears Heaven and did not act intentionally but inadvertently."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "Rashbam reads אשר here not as 'when' but as a relative particle referring to the status/position of the nasi, citing two biblical parallels where אשר means 'which/that'."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:18.534228125Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}